WEBVTT

00:04.060 --> 00:07.330
How can I be so useless at a time like this?!

00:07.330 --> 00:09.090
Don't overdo it, Botts.

00:09.090 --> 00:11.240
Yuna will bring another chef.

00:11.760 --> 00:14.450
You should focus on your recovery.

00:14.810 --> 00:20.700
Lord Gran saved me after I was kicked out 
of the royal capital by a jealous superior!

00:21.280 --> 00:26.380
I can't leave my savior's party
 to some unknown chef!

00:27.040 --> 00:29.090
Your unknown chef is here.

00:29.550 --> 00:33.670
How many years has it been since 
we sharpened our skills together?

00:34.130 --> 00:36.140
You've had it rough, Botts.

00:36.140 --> 00:37.470
Zelef?!

00:37.470 --> 00:39.060
Yuna Sis!

00:37.470 --> 00:39.060
Miss Yuna!

00:37.470 --> 00:39.060
Sister Yuna!

00:39.060 --> 00:41.920
Cliff, could that gentleman be...

00:41.920 --> 00:46.100
Yes. Looks like Yuna brought 
a crazy replacement.

00:46.100 --> 00:48.890
Why is the royal head chef here?!

00:48.890 --> 00:50.480
Royal head chef?!

00:50.480 --> 00:55.820
Friend, as a fellow chef, I understand 
your anger and frustration well.

00:56.170 --> 01:00.710
Will you allow an unknown chef 
like me to share your troubles?

01:00.710 --> 01:03.160
Yes, I have no qualms if it's you!

01:03.540 --> 01:06.870
We have no time. We must 
prepare a new party menu!

01:08.560 --> 01:12.840
I'm excited to work side-by-side 
with you once again.

01:12.840 --> 01:16.470
Yes! Please look at the ingredients 
that have been prepared!

01:16.470 --> 01:19.540
Yes! What are the local specialties here?

01:19.540 --> 01:22.530
I can't believe you were able to 
bring the royal head chef!

01:22.530 --> 01:24.330
You're amazing, Miss Yuna!

01:24.330 --> 01:26.510
Welcome back, Yuna Sis.

01:26.510 --> 01:28.220
Yeah. I'm back.

01:28.990 --> 01:32.770
I can't wait for the birthday party.

01:32.770 --> 01:35.400
Yes! Sister Yuna!

03:06.950 --> 03:08.790
The time has finally come.

03:08.790 --> 03:14.050
I managed to put that old geezer Gran into 
a tight spot by bribing the merchant guild.

03:14.050 --> 03:17.580
I've also obtained the weaknesses 
of all his allies.

03:17.580 --> 03:19.950
You've also done an excellent job, Brad.

03:19.950 --> 03:22.930
You were able to injure that chef 
and that brat Cliff's knights

03:22.930 --> 03:26.170
without leaving any proof.

03:26.170 --> 03:27.960
Just doing my job.

03:28.930 --> 03:33.020
I'm glad I hired someone that even 
the adventurer's guild considered a hot potato.

03:33.500 --> 03:38.470
The terrible food will completely crush 
what's left of that geezer's public image.

03:38.470 --> 03:42.910
I, Gajurdo Salbard, will finally 
obtain all of Sheelin.

03:42.910 --> 03:44.980
But you're too nice, Dad.

03:44.980 --> 03:49.620
It would've been better to 
kill the chef and knights.

03:50.820 --> 03:54.380
That's right! We should also finish off 
the people we imprisoned underground!

03:56.730 --> 04:00.170
After all, no one can go against us anymore!

04:00.170 --> 04:04.770
You stupid child! The party would be 
called off if there were any deaths!

04:04.770 --> 04:08.300
Also, hostages are only useful 
when they're alive!

04:09.890 --> 04:12.170
<i>Did I spoil him too much?</i>

04:12.170 --> 04:15.350
<i>Looks like I'll have to discipline him a bit.</i>

04:15.350 --> 04:22.530
Now, let's see what kind of food they'll 
serve at the party celebrating my glory!

04:26.820 --> 04:32.720
Thank you for attending 
my birthday party today.

04:32.720 --> 04:40.030
Please enjoy the food, alcohol, and music 
we have prepared with the utmost sincerity.

04:42.230 --> 04:47.160
Is that so? Our lord has said the same...

04:47.160 --> 04:48.710
As hearty as ever.

04:48.710 --> 04:50.030
Yes.

04:50.030 --> 04:53.020
Why, hello, Lord Gran.

04:53.540 --> 04:56.750
Congratulations on your fiftieth birthday.

04:56.750 --> 04:58.980
Thank you for coming, Lord Gajurdo.

04:58.980 --> 05:04.190
I heard the eastern district had been 
lifeless lately, but it seems I was mistaken.

05:04.190 --> 05:08.750
Well, I've been a lord a lot longer than you.

05:08.750 --> 05:13.430
I hope you can forget about work 
tonight and enjoy yourselves.

05:14.030 --> 05:20.550
I heard that your chef was a sous chef from 
a famous restaurant in the royal capital?

05:20.550 --> 05:24.670
Yes, I'm sure I'll enjoy things very much.

05:26.790 --> 05:28.050
That bastard...

05:28.050 --> 05:30.900
We can only wait and see.

05:30.900 --> 05:32.430
That's right.

05:39.710 --> 05:42.750
I hope Lady Noa and Lady Misa 
are all right...

05:42.750 --> 05:47.780
Well, I'm sure that stupid son of his 
won't cause too much of a disturbance here.

05:48.410 --> 05:50.370
This is good, too!

05:52.320 --> 05:54.540
So good!

05:59.440 --> 06:01.960
Remember the faces of 
the people who talk to Gran.

06:01.960 --> 06:08.270
We'll have to show any fool that goes 
to his side who's really in power.

06:08.270 --> 06:12.300
We'll have to nip any idiots 
like that in the bud.

06:12.300 --> 06:17.690
Of course. Sheelin can only prosper 
in the hands of Lord Gajurdo.

06:17.690 --> 06:20.070
What should we do about Cliff Foschurose?

06:20.070 --> 06:24.110
I heard Crimonia has been gaining 
a lot of power under him.

06:25.340 --> 06:27.780
A brat like him is hardly a problem.

06:27.780 --> 06:30.500
He's just a feudal lord 
that gained a little land

06:30.500 --> 06:32.950
because his wife is favored by the king.

06:33.320 --> 06:36.060
Enough. Let's begin.

06:38.270 --> 06:41.280
<i>It looks good, but I'm 
sure the taste is terrible.</i>

06:42.310 --> 06:45.210
<i>Gran, you'll embarrass yourself tonight!</i>

07:02.060 --> 07:04.610
<i>Impossible! What's going on?!</i>

07:04.610 --> 07:06.190
What?!

07:06.190 --> 07:08.030
This is too delicious!

07:08.030 --> 07:10.360
I've never had food this delicious before!

07:12.390 --> 07:16.100
So good! So good! Why is it 
all so freaking good?!

07:17.020 --> 07:20.290
A poverty-stricken family 
serving this is so impudent!

07:20.760 --> 07:22.730
<i>You stupid boy!</i>

07:22.730 --> 07:23.750
Splendid...

07:23.750 --> 07:27.170
It's more delicious than 
the restaurants in the royal capital!

07:24.690 --> 07:26.790
How can it be so delicious?!

07:26.790 --> 07:28.380
Amazing!

07:27.170 --> 07:29.630
It looks as wonderful as it tastes.

07:27.170 --> 07:29.630
The Farrengram family is as stable as ever.

07:29.630 --> 07:31.300
<i>Not good...</i>

07:31.300 --> 07:35.850
<i>However, I can take care of them 
after crushing Gran's public image.</i>

07:38.390 --> 07:39.910
I can no longer hold back!

07:39.910 --> 07:42.110
What is this pig’s slop?!

07:42.110 --> 07:46.610
How dare the Farrengram family serve 
such disgusting food at a party?!

07:47.000 --> 07:50.610
My goodness! This is an embarrassment 
to the city of Sheelin!

07:50.610 --> 07:52.990
Did the food not suit your taste?

07:52.990 --> 07:57.530
Yes, I can't believe this is the work 
of a former sous chef from the royal capital.

07:57.530 --> 08:01.060
Or could it be that a different 
chef cooked this trash?

08:02.000 --> 08:04.960
Well, it's true that a different 
chef prepared this food.

08:04.960 --> 08:06.290
I see!

08:06.290 --> 08:09.730
You didn't use your exclusive chef 
for such an important party?

08:09.730 --> 08:12.970
Do you look down on your guests?

08:12.970 --> 08:14.630
Not at all.

08:14.630 --> 08:18.530
He is another excellent chef, one who 
doesn't pale in comparison to Botts!

08:19.130 --> 08:20.890
<i>What a bold front.</i>

08:21.650 --> 08:25.350
You consider this terrible food amazing?!

08:25.350 --> 08:27.940
It seems the Farrengram family 
has fallen so far as to be on the ground!

08:27.940 --> 08:29.680
Th-That's right!

08:29.680 --> 08:31.400
To serve food like this!

08:31.400 --> 08:33.610
This is truly pig's slop!

08:35.070 --> 08:37.780
<i>No. Things are going so well...</i>

08:39.390 --> 08:41.250
<i>I can't stop myself from smiling...</i>

08:42.650 --> 08:44.190
<i>Right, Yuna?</i>

08:45.610 --> 08:47.500
Now there's nothing to worry about.

08:47.500 --> 08:48.950
Thank you, Miss Yuna.

08:48.950 --> 08:51.300
I'm glad Mr. Zelef could come,

08:51.300 --> 08:53.630
but we still need to think of 
countermeasures during the party.

08:58.050 --> 08:59.320
Hold on!

08:59.320 --> 09:00.960
You <i>can't</i> think a bad guy would be satisfied

09:00.960 --> 09:02.510
with just attacking your chef, right?!

09:02.510 --> 09:04.390
He'll definitely do something at the party!

09:04.390 --> 09:06.730
A-At the party?

09:06.730 --> 09:09.430
What do you think he'd do?

09:09.430 --> 09:14.970
Well, he knows your chef is out of 
commission, so he'll complain.

09:14.970 --> 09:18.070
"How can I eat such terrible food?!"

09:18.070 --> 09:19.160
You're right...

09:19.920 --> 09:24.470
That's pretty benign, so he might 
also plant bugs or trash in the food.

09:24.470 --> 09:26.750
Or he could poison a useless subordinate

09:26.750 --> 09:31.640
and blame your food to take care 
of two birds with one stone.

09:32.810 --> 09:35.070
Why're you guys looking at me like that?!

09:37.060 --> 09:39.780
So mean. I just answered 
their question seriously.

09:39.780 --> 09:41.950
What are we going to do?

09:41.950 --> 09:44.810
It turned out just like you imagined.

09:44.810 --> 09:46.520
We're already prepared.

09:44.810 --> 09:47.830
What's wrong with saying something 
tastes terrible when it does?

09:46.520 --> 09:49.230
That man will be the key to our victory.

09:50.300 --> 09:54.440
It looked like you were eating 
it with gusto just now...

09:54.440 --> 09:56.390
I don't know what you're talking about.

09:56.390 --> 09:59.160
It's terrible if I say it's terrible.

09:59.160 --> 10:00.500
Goodness.

10:00.890 --> 10:04.050
I can't believe you managed 
to rule the city until now.

10:04.050 --> 10:06.390
Doesn't everyone agree?

10:06.390 --> 10:10.040
Now that he mentions it...

10:15.390 --> 10:19.870
<i>Anything I say is terrible becomes terrible.
 My words become the truth.</i>

10:19.870 --> 10:21.470
Excuse me.

10:26.420 --> 10:31.610
I am Zelef, the chef that 
prepared the food for this party.

10:34.940 --> 10:38.740
Did you truly dislike the food I prepared?

10:39.140 --> 10:42.040
<i>Where have I seen this man before?</i>

10:43.080 --> 10:44.850
Yes, that's right!

10:44.850 --> 10:47.600
How dare you present such disgusting food!

10:47.600 --> 10:52.750
You and your master must be a joke 
if you're satisfied with something like this!

10:53.310 --> 10:54.630
I see...

10:55.170 --> 10:58.840
Then, can you please tell me exactly what 
about the dishes were not to your taste?

10:58.840 --> 11:00.150
What?!

11:00.840 --> 11:04.050
A mere chef is asking for the opinion 
of a noble instead of apologizing?!

11:04.050 --> 11:08.230
I will apologize with all of my heart 
if my food was truly unpalatable.

11:08.230 --> 11:14.150
However, it is an insult to my master, 
who loves food, if I apologize without reason.

11:15.400 --> 11:18.060
There's no reason! It's all terrible!

11:18.060 --> 11:21.340
I question the taste of anyone 
who thinks it's delicious!

11:21.340 --> 11:23.070
I understand.

11:23.070 --> 11:25.060
I will be sure to relay that to my master,

11:25.890 --> 11:28.540
His Majesty, The King.

11:33.830 --> 11:37.750
His Majesty, The King?

11:37.750 --> 11:39.810
That's right! Zelef!

11:39.810 --> 11:41.720
It's the royal head chef, Zelef!

11:41.720 --> 11:44.560
I thought he seemed familiar!

11:44.560 --> 11:47.800
It seemed all of you were 
unsatisfied with the food as well.

11:48.950 --> 11:52.030
You called it pig's slop?

11:53.270 --> 11:56.150
Please tell me in detail.

11:56.150 --> 12:00.260
I cannot allow myself to 
serve His Majesty such food.

12:00.860 --> 12:02.700
No, that's, well...

12:03.070 --> 12:04.660
Please.

12:07.560 --> 12:09.770
I am very sorry, Mister Zelef.

12:09.770 --> 12:13.790
It seems my sense of taste 
is off because of a cold.

12:14.350 --> 12:16.370
A-Actually, me, too...

12:16.900 --> 12:19.490
What a coincidence! Me, too.

12:20.760 --> 12:23.220
U-Um, Lord Gran...

12:23.220 --> 12:26.030
Yes, please take care of your health.

12:26.030 --> 12:27.540
Th-Thank you very much!

12:27.540 --> 12:28.340
What?!

12:28.340 --> 12:29.500
Well, then.

12:29.500 --> 12:31.100
E-Excuse us!

12:31.100 --> 12:32.390
Y-You bastards!

12:33.760 --> 12:36.780
Wh-Why are you here in a place like this?

12:36.780 --> 12:39.070
Does His Majesty know your whereabouts?

12:39.070 --> 12:40.490
Of course.

12:40.490 --> 12:46.000
Lady Ellalaura informed me that 
an old friend of mine was injured

12:46.000 --> 12:47.450
and asked me to come.

12:47.450 --> 12:50.640
You came running after you 
heard the chef was attacked?

12:50.640 --> 12:52.660
Impossible. There wasn't enough time...

12:52.660 --> 12:57.510
Oh? You knew he was injured from an <i>attack</i>?

12:57.510 --> 12:59.980
Perhaps you even know the culprit?

12:59.980 --> 13:03.380
No, I heard some rumors about town!

13:04.130 --> 13:08.010
Even so, please don't be mistaken, Mister Zelef!

13:08.010 --> 13:12.680
It wasn't truly unpalatable. 
The food was quite delicious.

13:12.680 --> 13:16.020
You definitely said it was 
disgusting moments ago.

13:16.020 --> 13:17.900
W-Well, that's...

13:20.700 --> 13:24.440
I-It seems I am feeling unwell myself!

13:24.940 --> 13:28.530
I'm sorry for my rudeness before, L-Lord Gran...

13:28.910 --> 13:31.950
It cannot be helped if you're sick.

13:31.950 --> 13:35.000
Please rest and take care of your health.

13:35.000 --> 13:38.330
I-I-I appreciate your consideration.

13:38.700 --> 13:42.430
Mister Zelef, please give my 
regards to His Majesty...

13:42.430 --> 13:44.620
Dad! Why are you bowing 
your head to these...

13:44.620 --> 13:45.650
Quiet!

13:46.130 --> 13:48.050
Huh? Wait, Dad?!

13:48.400 --> 13:50.260
What's going on?

13:48.400 --> 13:50.260
Shut your mouth!

13:55.270 --> 13:58.780
We apologize for the interruption.

13:58.780 --> 14:05.760
Please have some pudding, which was
 presented at the royal banquet,

14:05.760 --> 14:09.030
to cleanse your palate of the matter.

14:19.420 --> 14:22.600
I'm sure Gajurdo will stay quiet for a while.

14:22.960 --> 14:25.730
This is all thanks to the young lady.

14:25.730 --> 14:27.590
Mister Zelef did all the work.

14:27.590 --> 14:31.990
I didn't expect him to face 
the enemy so confidently.

14:31.990 --> 14:35.110
As a chef, I couldn't forgive 
their treatment of a comrade

14:35.110 --> 14:37.820
and their blatant disrespect for food.

14:37.820 --> 14:40.040
Zelef, thank you so much!

14:40.860 --> 14:42.810
It's nothing, Botts.

14:43.500 --> 14:47.580
<i>Looks like the problem 
has been solved for now.</i>

14:49.750 --> 14:51.200
You must be kidding me!

14:51.740 --> 14:55.490
Why did the royal head chef appear?!

14:55.490 --> 14:59.040
Ellalaura, that sly fox!

14:59.510 --> 15:02.660
I don't know how much information 
is in the king's hands,

15:02.660 --> 15:05.710
so I can't move recklessly 
while Zelef is here.

15:05.710 --> 15:08.130
What are you so afraid of, Dad?

15:08.130 --> 15:11.560
Even if he's the royal head chef,
 he's still just a chef.

15:11.560 --> 15:13.930
Don't lump him together with other chefs!

15:13.930 --> 15:18.210
A single report from him could send the public
 image of the Salbard family plummeting.

15:18.210 --> 15:20.060
Then let's get rid of him.

15:20.060 --> 15:22.980
If we get rid of him, he can't 
report a thing to the king.

15:22.980 --> 15:24.870
You fool!

15:24.870 --> 15:28.580
You better stay quiet for now, too! Got it?!

15:29.440 --> 15:30.380
<i>Shit!</i>

15:30.380 --> 15:33.210
<i>Dad, Misa-na, and that shitty woman!</i>

15:33.210 --> 15:36.080
<i>They all treat me like an idiot!</i>

15:36.080 --> 15:38.410
<i>Don't think I'll leave things like this!</i>

15:43.530 --> 15:45.950
And turn, rwar!

15:45.950 --> 15:47.590
Rwar!

15:47.590 --> 15:50.860
Hibernate until spring. Snore. Snore.

15:50.860 --> 15:53.380
Snore. Snore.

15:56.330 --> 15:58.440
What are you all doing?

15:59.560 --> 16:00.970
Mother?!

16:00.970 --> 16:03.800
Hi, Noa. I'm glad to see you well.

16:03.800 --> 16:05.340
Misa and Fina, too.

16:05.340 --> 16:07.570
Y-Yes, I'm doing well!

16:07.570 --> 16:09.990
It has been a long time, Aunt Ellalaura.

16:09.990 --> 16:12.450
Why are you here, Mother?

16:12.450 --> 16:15.870
I came to see my beloved daughter.

16:15.870 --> 16:16.530
Oh, my.

16:17.020 --> 16:19.030
Your clothes are dirty.

16:19.510 --> 16:21.450
Um, this is...

16:21.450 --> 16:23.720
Th-There is a good reason for this!

16:23.720 --> 16:30.020
That's right. We were bored of being 
stuck in the mansion and asked Sister Yuna...

16:30.020 --> 16:32.050
I'm not angry with you girls.

16:33.100 --> 16:37.640
The reason those girls 
can't leave the mansion...

16:37.640 --> 16:40.980
The stupid nobles will probably stay quiet

16:40.980 --> 16:44.350
because they're scared of 
the king while Mister Zelef is here,

16:44.350 --> 16:47.170
but the adults wanted to be extra cautious.

16:47.170 --> 16:51.610
Did you come to Sheelin because 
of the stupid nobles, too, Mrs. Ellalaura?

16:51.610 --> 16:56.040
Well, it's ten percent work, 
ten percent to see Cliff,

16:56.040 --> 16:59.700
and eighty percent to see Noa 
and celebrate Misa's birthday.

16:59.700 --> 17:02.540
<i>You should increase the 
percentage of work and Cliff.</i>

17:02.960 --> 17:08.060
Jokes aside, the royal family feels a little 
responsible about the issue in Sheelin.

17:08.060 --> 17:12.590
That's why I've been sent to 
personally inspect the city.

17:12.590 --> 17:14.800
You're not going to capture them right away?

17:14.800 --> 17:16.810
There's no proof.

17:16.810 --> 17:18.280
I would only be able to do something

17:18.280 --> 17:24.890
if the Salbard family committed 
a crime right in front of me.

17:24.890 --> 17:28.100
Well, I'm sure even they aren't <i>that</i> stupid.

17:30.690 --> 17:35.150
Well, that'll be something to worry 
about after Misa's birthday party tonight.

17:35.150 --> 17:36.370
You're right.

17:36.370 --> 17:40.490
I can't wait to eat Mister Zelef's food 
and see the dresses the girls wear!

17:40.490 --> 17:42.370
Exactly right!

17:42.370 --> 17:47.130
I'm here to see my cute 
daughter wear a dress.

17:47.130 --> 17:49.840
Of course, you'll be wearing one, too?

17:49.840 --> 17:52.400
No way. I'm not.

17:52.400 --> 17:54.160
Don't say that!

17:54.160 --> 17:56.040
I am not.

17:56.040 --> 17:57.620
Now, now!

17:57.620 --> 17:58.660
Definitely not.

17:58.660 --> 18:00.040
Come, now!

18:00.790 --> 18:01.970
No!

18:02.920 --> 18:04.060
Don't come any closer!

18:04.060 --> 18:07.520
Why? Why me?

18:07.940 --> 18:10.830
Why do you have a dress ready for me?!

18:10.830 --> 18:13.570
Now, Miss Yuna. It's time to change.

18:13.570 --> 18:16.110
Yeah, I think it'll look good on you.

18:16.110 --> 18:18.350
Fina, you betrayed me?!

18:18.350 --> 18:22.410
Really? After you left me behind 
last time, Yuna Sis?

18:28.000 --> 18:30.270
Why are you so reluctant?

18:30.270 --> 18:32.660
Misa would be so happy.

18:33.160 --> 18:37.680
I want to wear pretty 
dresses with Yuna Sis...

18:38.380 --> 18:40.340
Can't we?

18:38.380 --> 18:40.340
Can't we?

18:43.990 --> 18:45.470
Fine.

18:45.470 --> 18:47.680
Fine! I got it!

18:49.720 --> 18:52.860
Only on one condition!

19:01.280 --> 19:06.200
<b>Bear, Going Bare</b>

19:01.280 --> 19:06.200
<b>Bear, Going Bare</b>

19:08.450 --> 19:09.980
How splendid!

19:09.980 --> 19:11.760
Noa and Fina are cute,

19:11.760 --> 19:15.840
but it's rare to see Yuna dressed 
so cutely in a different way!

19:15.840 --> 19:19.010
Don't look at me too much.

19:19.010 --> 19:22.430
I didn't recognize you for a moment.

19:22.430 --> 19:24.400
What a complete change.

19:24.400 --> 19:26.720
The two of you are terrible.

19:26.720 --> 19:29.600
Her bear suit is cute as well!

19:31.240 --> 19:36.260
You look so beautiful. It's like you're 
a princess from the bear kingdom.

19:36.260 --> 19:37.350
Right?!

19:37.350 --> 19:40.010
We were so enamored with her ourselves!

19:40.010 --> 19:41.070
Right, Fina?

19:41.070 --> 19:44.280
Yes, Yuna Sis is so pretty!

19:44.680 --> 19:47.490
Don't look at me like that.

19:47.490 --> 19:50.350
So you really are human, Yuna.

19:50.350 --> 19:51.290
I'm going to Bear Punch you.

19:51.290 --> 19:52.810
I'm kidding.

19:52.810 --> 19:56.100
What's going on with your hands and feet?

19:56.100 --> 20:00.720
This was her condition to wear the dress. 
She said she couldn't take them off.

20:00.720 --> 20:04.260
<i>I'm just a weak modern girl 
without my bear equipment.</i>

20:04.260 --> 20:09.180
<i>At the very least, I can't 
take off the shoes and gloves!</i>

20:10.100 --> 20:12.810
Sister Yuna, you look so beautiful!

20:12.810 --> 20:15.650
Thanks. You look very cute, Misa.

20:16.950 --> 20:22.240
Now, let us begin my granddaughter 
Misa-na's tenth birthday party.

20:22.240 --> 20:24.870
Misa, happy birthday!

20:24.870 --> 20:26.700
Thank you very much!

20:45.830 --> 20:48.420
Welp, guess it's my turn.

20:50.920 --> 20:53.390
They're stuffed Kumayuru and Kumakyu bears.

20:54.560 --> 20:57.830
Wh-What's this?! Wh-What in the world is this?!

20:57.830 --> 21:00.020
So cute! So cute!

21:00.020 --> 21:01.780
Miss Yuna, please give them to me!

21:01.780 --> 21:03.860
Of course you can't have them.

21:03.860 --> 21:06.330
They're Misa's birthday present.

21:06.330 --> 21:08.950
No way!

21:11.230 --> 21:14.960
Why? Why isn't it my birthday today?

21:14.960 --> 21:19.630
Father, Mother... Why didn't 
you give birth to me today?

21:19.630 --> 21:21.340
Don't be unreasonable.

21:21.340 --> 21:23.640
These are really cute.

21:23.640 --> 21:27.120
I'm sure there are many people 
who would want them.

21:28.050 --> 21:32.680
I've already ordered more. I'll send 
one set to Princess Flora next time.

21:32.680 --> 21:37.550
I'm glad to hear that. Please prepare
 a set for Shia and me as well.

21:37.550 --> 21:38.560
Miss Yuna?!

21:38.560 --> 21:42.830
You'll have to wait for it, but I've
 ordered a set for you, Noa.

21:42.830 --> 21:45.350
I-If that's the case...

21:47.150 --> 21:49.060
Good for you, Misa.

21:49.620 --> 21:50.700
Yes!

21:52.320 --> 21:54.850
Thank you very much!

21:54.850 --> 21:59.400
This is the best birthday party I've ever had!

21:59.710 --> 22:04.510
<i>Thank goodness. Looks like we were 
able to protect that smile of hers.</i>

23:35.390 --> 23:39.980
<b>Tale of a Bear</b>

23:35.430 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.950 --> 23:37.440
Bear.
